Long ago, a great civilization flourished—one that believed true power could only be proven through mastery of the blade.
This civilization fell victim to an excessive zeal for combat; not only did fewer people care about sustaining the population, but internal conflicts were increasingly resolved through armed force. Today, the task of rebuilding that shattered civilization shapes the lives of many. Yet, traces of the past world remain; in many regions, skilled swordsmen command great respect. It is not merely ancient customs that endure; scattered across the world—hidden away and heavily guarded—lie powerful artifacts from that bygone era. Obtaining one of these artifacts is the driving ambition of nearly every adventurer.
Now, you too have been born into this world and must forge your own path within it.